{"4669300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Speed King", "steam_appid": 4669300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4900770], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEED KING</strong> is a multiplayer bonkers racing game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream it, and you can achieve it. You want to run as a <strong>pig</strong> against a <strong>kaiju</strong>? Now you can \\o/! Maybe try out a <strong>wheelchair</strong> against a <strong>train</strong>? We're your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND YOUR SPIRITUAL RACER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pig, Horse, Garbage truck, Wheelchair, Kaiju, Gorilla, and many others; pick your champion and let's race to find out who is <strong>THE BOSS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/503055e3933c5f20b4831c3fe5b25be5.poster.avif?t=1788289759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/503055e3933c5f20b4831c3fe5b25be5.webm?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/503055e3933c5f20b4831c3fe5b25be5.mp4?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIRTY DEEDS DONE DIRT CHEAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why enraging your rival is so pleasant! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire whatever you have in hand: poop, bins, anchors, magnets, horseshoes, and make their life harder after a long day of work that they just wanted to relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/d948d6df66c0cf5bbead76bf12bc3ef5.poster.avif?t=1788289759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/d948d6df66c0cf5bbead76bf12bc3ef5.webm?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/d948d6df66c0cf5bbead76bf12bc3ef5.mp4?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO TWO MATCHES ARE EVER THE SAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino, School, Alien planet, Farm, and many other places where you're gonna do your underground racing, and others might say that you are fast and furious...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/adc9afb14ed19bcb326e9077f3df076a.poster.avif?t=1788289759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/adc9afb14ed19bcb326e9077f3df076a.webm?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/adc9afb14ed19bcb326e9077f3df076a.mp4?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of power-ups to turn every match into pure chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters and items as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across a variety of unique arenas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PSSST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not winning, don't worry, we have a solo game against bots and time trials so you can &quot;crush your enemies, see them driven before you, and hear the lamentation of their women&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for reading everything (or not), love you, xoxo.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEED KING</strong> is a multiplayer bonkers racing game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream it, and you can achieve it. You want to run as a <strong>pig</strong> against a <strong>kaiju</strong>? Now you can \\o/! Maybe try out a <strong>wheelchair</strong> against a <strong>train</strong>? We're your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND YOUR SPIRITUAL RACER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pig, Horse, Garbage truck, Wheelchair, Kaiju, Gorilla, and many others; pick your champion and let's race to find out who is <strong>THE BOSS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/503055e3933c5f20b4831c3fe5b25be5.poster.avif?t=1788289759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/503055e3933c5f20b4831c3fe5b25be5.webm?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/503055e3933c5f20b4831c3fe5b25be5.mp4?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIRTY DEEDS DONE DIRT CHEAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why enraging your rival is so pleasant! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire whatever you have in hand: poop, bins, anchors, magnets, horseshoes, and make their life harder after a long day of work that they just wanted to relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/d948d6df66c0cf5bbead76bf12bc3ef5.poster.avif?t=1788289759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/d948d6df66c0cf5bbead76bf12bc3ef5.webm?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/d948d6df66c0cf5bbead76bf12bc3ef5.mp4?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO TWO MATCHES ARE EVER THE SAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino, School, Alien planet, Farm, and many other places where you're gonna do your underground racing, and others might say that you are fast and furious...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/adc9afb14ed19bcb326e9077f3df076a.poster.avif?t=1788289759\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/adc9afb14ed19bcb326e9077f3df076a.webm?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/extras/adc9afb14ed19bcb326e9077f3df076a.mp4?t=1788289759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of power-ups to turn every match into pure chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters and items as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across a variety of unique arenas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PSSST!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not winning, don't worry, we have a solo game against bots and time trials so you can &quot;crush your enemies, see them driven before you, and hear the lamentation of their women&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for reading everything (or not), love you, xoxo.</p>", "short_description": "Chaotic Racing matches for up to 4 players through silly levels, with anything you can imagine: pigs, kaijus, wheelchairs, and so on. Use crazy power-ups, battle through unique arenas and opponents, and turn every friendly match into a chaotic showdown with friends.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/17a440601f64db571c97b3b8e6ec886c284a9e2b/header.jpg?t=1788289759", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/a712da32035ac115ed9a820bb200e6c1c7fd70c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788289759", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669300/a712da32035ac115ed9a820bb200e6c1c7fd70c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788289759", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 1903 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core x86_64 with SSE4.2 (Intel Core i3-4000 / AMD FX-4300 or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan 1.0 compatible GPU with 1 GB VRAM (Intel HD Graphics 520, NVIDIA GeForce GT 710, AMD Radeon HD 7750 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><